---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="How to Help — Base Impact" description="Ways to support Base Impact: donate, volunteer, supply needs, device donations, partnerships, and spreading the word in Brevard County, FL.">
  <div class="picture-band">
    <img src="/assets/tech-support-session.jpg" alt="Technology support session helping a neighbor" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </div>
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-body mb-4 fade-in">How to Help</h1>
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-muted leading-relaxed fade-in">
    There are many ways to support Base Impact's work in Brevard County. Money, supplies,
    devices, time, and a voice in the community all move the same mission forward.
  </p>

  <section class="mt-8 fade-in">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mb-3">Give financially</h2>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-4">
      Base Impact is a Florida nonprofit corporation. Gifts fund devices, connectivity, cold-weather
      supplies, and one-on-one training. Give online through Zeffy — no fees, 100% goes to Base Impact.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <a href="https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/peer-to-peer/50k-for-base-impact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-700 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800 btn-pill">Donate now</a>
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      <li><strong>Devices</strong> — Refurbished computers and tablets for neighbors who need them.</li>
      <li><strong>Internet access</strong> — Hotspots, data plans, and help applying for service subsidies.</li>
      <li><strong>Cold-weather supplies</strong> — Jackets, hoodies, blankets, socks, gloves, and hygiene kits.</li>
      <li><strong>Training</strong> — One-on-one digital skills sessions for housing, jobs, and benefits.</li>
      <li><strong>Nonprofit tech support</strong> — Free setup and security for small community organizations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-xs text-faint mt-4">To give another way — by phone, mail, or employer matching — <a href="/contact" class="text-accent font-semibold">contact us</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 fade-in">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mb-3">Give supplies</h2>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-3">
      Cold-weather season is when demand spikes. New or gently used items are always welcome:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      <li>Jackets and hoodies, especially larger sizes (2XL+)</li>
      <li>Blankets, sleeping bags, and thermal socks</li>
      <li>Gloves, hats, and rain gear</li>
      <li>Hygiene kits — soap, toothbrushes, toothpaste, shampoo, period supplies</li>
      <li>Reusable bags and backpacks for carrying supplies</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-faint mt-4">Arrange a drop-off through the <a href="/contact" class="text-accent font-semibold">contact page</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 fade-in">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mb-3">Give devices</h2>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Working phones, tablets, laptops, chargers, and accessories go to neighbors who need them —
      or into our refurbishment program, where volunteers wipe, repair, and redeploy donated
      technology. Anything that holds data is wiped before reuse.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 fade-in">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mb-3">Give your time</h2>
    <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Serve a shift, help with devices, teach digital skills, or verify resources. See current
      opportunities on our <a href="/volunteer" class="text-accent font-semibold">volunteer page</a> and sign up on the
      <a href="/events" class="text-accent font-semibold">events page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-8 fade-in">
    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-body mb-3">Partner or spread the word</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      <li><strong>Partner</strong> — Churches, pantries, and community groups can co-deliver programs and share resources. See our <a href="/partners" class="text-accent font-semibold">partners page</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Spread the word</strong> — Tell neighbors, churches, and community groups about the free resource directory. The more people who know, the more people we can help.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-faint">
    Base Impact Inc. is a Florida nonprofit corporation. 501(c)(3) tax-exempt status is pending;
    donations are not currently tax-deductible. Please consult your tax advisor.
  </p>
</Base>
